1
00:00:02,181 --> 00:00:03,662
As Uke strikes

2
00:00:03,663 --> 00:00:05,861
slide forward controlling his arm, 

3
00:00:06,062 --> 00:00:09,647
as you make contact turn your hip sharply 
to take Uke´s balance

4
00:00:09,848 --> 00:00:13,682
as you do so slide your outside hand around 
to control his wrist,

5
00:00:13,983 --> 00:00:15,172
step forward deeply,

6
00:00:15,173 --> 00:00:16,807
taking his body down to the mat

7
00:00:17,208 --> 00:00:20,962
as you do so, 
sit down controlling Uke´s arm

8
00:00:21,263 --> 00:00:24,846
come around the front with Uke´s shoulder 
in between your knees,

9
00:00:24,847 --> 00:00:27,165
placing his wrist against your elbow,

10
00:00:27,166 --> 00:00:28,881
holding him close against your body

11
00:00:29,282 --> 00:00:31,404
as you do so, pin.

